  "title": {
    "zh": "YS儿童DIY插珠帐篷拼搭套装",
    "en": "YS Kids DIY Fort Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童创意拼搭场景的DIY插珠帐篷套装，采用杆件与连接球结构，可组合搭建帐篷、城堡与通道造型，适合亲子互动与课堂活动。\n\n品牌为尧顺，材质为PP，产地东莞茶山，包含专利申请时间信息，支持渠道长期供货。",
    "en": "This is a DIY fort-building set for kids’ creative construction scenarios. It uses rods and connector balls to build tents, castles, and tunnel-like shapes for parent-child interaction and classroom activities.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Material: PP. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. Patent filing date information is included for channel documentation and long-term supply."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款YS儿童DIY插珠帐篷拼搭套装采用“杆件+连接球”结构，支持搭建帐篷、房屋和堡垒等多种形态，适合家庭与教学场景中的互动玩法。",
      "产品主材为PP，支持反复拆装和重构，能够用于空间认知、动手训练与亲子协作活动。品牌为尧顺，应用场景覆盖零售与教育配套。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，规格为绿色杆子86+44橙色球，并保留专利申请时间等资料字段，便于渠道整理与批量采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This YS kids DIY fort set uses a rod-and-connector structure to build tents, houses, and fortress-style shapes, making it suitable for interactive home and educational scenarios.",
      "The main material is PP and the set supports repeated assembly and reconfiguration for spatial learning, hands-on practice, and parent-child collaboration. Brand: Yaoshun.",
      "Packed in a color box, the configuration is 86 green rods + 44 orange connector balls. Patent filing date details are retained for channel documentation and bulk procurement workflows."
    ]
  },
